    "title": "3 alligators shot in Fort Worth nature preserve, reward offered - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Alexsis Jones ,\n1 days ago The illegal shooting of three alligators inside a Fort Worth nature preserve has sparked a state investigation — and a potential reward for information. Two of the alligators were killed and abandoned, while the third survived, according to a social media post from the Texas Parks and Wildlife Department, which announced the $1,000 reward for information. Read full article\n2",
